{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D/2D board game about hunting killers and sacrificing others for your own survival. Manage your resources wisely and explore the 2D city to defeat the mad king in the 3D realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, someone is guaranteed to die. Do your best to ensure it isn't you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds simultaneously in both 3D and 2D realms. Gather resources and interact with inhabitants in the 2D world to influence the events in the 3D one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/5e15f3e29ca72becf788171277f99362.poster.avif?t=1765528188\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/5e15f3e29ca72becf788171277f99362.webm?t=1765528188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/5e15f3e29ca72becf788171277f99362.mp4?t=1765528188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character is weak and heavily reliant on the people around you. You'll have to adapt when the king kills the most useful citizens at the most inopportune time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/f7632b4cff15d247bdc81d1ae07cc9f2.poster.avif?t=1765528188\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/f7632b4cff15d247bdc81d1ae07cc9f2.webm?t=1765528188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/f7632b4cff15d247bdc81d1ae07cc9f2.mp4?t=1765528188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to sacrifice others to stay alive. There is no other way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/f9e13eeb2ec1d110bd321f27fd99f9aa.poster.avif?t=1765528188\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/f9e13eeb2ec1d110bd321f27fd99f9aa.webm?t=1765528188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/f9e13eeb2ec1d110bd321f27fd99f9aa.mp4?t=1765528188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you unravel all the secrets of this small world to save the Princess and discover what she hides?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/94eb3d3b21195d42575d09dcde3ffce9.poster.avif?t=1765528188\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/94eb3d3b21195d42575d09dcde3ffce9.webm?t=1765528188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/94eb3d3b21195d42575d09dcde3ffce9.mp4?t=1765528188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086340?t=1765528188","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086340?t=1765528188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/e4ac9619147a